{"format":"kane-fabric-administrative-descriptor","format_version":1,"descriptor_id":"us.il.condominium.property","descriptor_version":1,"title":"Illinois Condominium — Property Identity, Plat & Tax","help":"Statewide Illinois condominium property identity, recording, unit/common-element interests, and separate real-estate taxation. Recorded declaration/plat requirements are Infrastructure; record references, unit designators, incorporation status, tax identifiers, and local taxing details are association-instance data.","scope":{"country_code":"US","state_code":"IL","label":"Illinois statewide condominium infrastructure","applies_to":"condominium_property","admission_rule":"Statewide Illinois applicability is required. County recorder implementation details, assessor workflows, parcel identifiers, municipal rules, and association-specific legal descriptions are instance data or deferred."},"categories":[{"id":"property.declaration","label":"Declaration and recording"},{"id":"property.plat","label":"Plat and survey"},{"id":"property.units","label":"Units and common-element interests"},{"id":"property.association_identity","label":"Association legal form"},{"id":"property.tax","label":"Separate real-estate taxation"}],"authorities":[{"id":"il-condo-act-2","kind":"state_statute","citation":"765 ILCS 605/2","url":"https://www.ilga.gov/legislation/ilcs/fulltext?DocName=076506050K2","summary":"Definitions for declaration, parcel, property, unit, common elements, and plat."},{"id":"il-condo-act-4","kind":"state_statute","citation":"765 ILCS 605/4","url":"https://www.ilga.gov/legislation/ilcs/fulltext?DocName=076506050K4","summary":"Required declaration contents."},{"id":"il-condo-act-5","kind":"state_statute","citation":"765 ILCS 605/5","url":"https://www.ilga.gov/legislation/ilcs/fulltext?DocName=076506050K5","summary":"Plat recording and Illinois land-surveyor requirements."},{"id":"il-condo-act-6","kind":"state_statute","citation":"765 ILCS 605/6","url":"https://www.ilga.gov/legislation/ilcs/fulltext?DocName=076506050K6","summary":"Effect of recording declaration and plat and inseparability of unit/common-element ownership."},{"id":"il-condo-act-10","kind":"state_statute","citation":"765 ILCS 605/10","url":"https://www.ilga.gov/legislation/ilcs/fulltext?DocName=076506050K10","summary":"Separate taxation of condominium units and related association tax provisions."},{"id":"il-condo-act-18-3","kind":"state_statute","citation":"765 ILCS 605/18.3","url":"https://www.ilga.gov/legislation/ilcs/fulltext?DocName=076506050K18.3","summary":"Unit owners association; association may be incorporated or unincorporated."}],"pages":[{"id":"property-identity","title":"Property Identity, Plat & Tax","help":"Recorded property identity and tax structure are statewide Infrastructure; actual recorder, survey, unit, corporate, and tax identifiers instantiate that framework.","sections":[{"id":"statewide-property-framework","title":"Statewide property and recording framework","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-2","il-condo-act-4","il-condo-act-5","il-condo-act-6","il-condo-act-10","il-condo-act-18-3"],"layout":{"columns":12},"controls":[{"id":"declaration-submission-rule","kind":"notice","text":"A declaration is the instrument by which property is submitted to the Illinois Condominium Property Act. The declaration must identify the parcel, units, condominium name and location, and each unit's percentage ownership interest in the common elements, together with the other particulars required by Section 4.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-2","il-condo-act-4"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":6}},{"id":"plat-recording-rule","kind":"notice","text":"A condominium plat must be recorded simultaneously with the declaration and must be made by a Registered Illinois Land Surveyor. Each unit must be identified on the plat by a distinguishing number or other symbol.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-5"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":1,"column":7,"span":6}},{"id":"recording-effect-rule","kind":"notice","text":"Upon compliance with Sections 3, 4, and 5 and recording of the declaration and plat, the property becomes subject to the Act and the units become separately transferable real property interests subject to the Act.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-6"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":2,"column":1,"span":6}},{"id":"common-interest-inseparability","kind":"notice","text":"Each unit carries the percentage ownership interest in the common elements stated in the declaration; ownership of the unit and its corresponding common-element interest generally may not be separated except as the Act permits.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-6"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":2,"column":7,"span":6}},{"id":"association-form-neutrality","kind":"notice","text":"The unit owners association administers the property through its board and may be incorporated or unincorporated. Incorporation is therefore an association-instance legal-form fact, not a universal Illinois condominium registration requirement.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-18-3"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":3,"column":1,"span":6}},{"id":"separate-taxation-rule","kind":"notice","text":"Real-property taxes, special assessments, and other lawful real-property charges are assessed against each unit together with the owner's corresponding common-element percentage as a tract, not against the condominium property as a whole.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-10"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":3,"column":7,"span":6}},{"id":"association-owned-residential-tax-rule","kind":"notice","text":"Qualifying real property owned and used for residential purposes by a condominium or master association and used exclusively by unit owners for recreational or other residential purposes is assessed at $1.00 per year under Section 10; the balance of value is assessed to condominium unit owners.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-10"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":4,"column":1,"span":6}},{"id":"taxing-district-rule","kind":"notice","text":"Each condominium unit is subject only to the tax rate for taxing districts in which that unit is physically located; the county clerk may not apply an average of different district rates to a unit.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-10"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":4,"column":7,"span":6}},{"id":"tax-relief-authority","kind":"notice","text":"With the authorization specified by Section 10, the board may act for all unit owners to seek relief concerning real-property taxes, special assessments, or charges and may treat related expenses as common expenses.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-10"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":5,"column":1,"span":12}}]},{"id":"recorded-property-instance","title":"Recorded property identity","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-4","il-condo-act-5","il-condo-act-6"],"layout":{"columns":12},"controls":[{"id":"condominium-name","kind":"text","label":"Recorded condominium name","binding":"association.property.condominium_name","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":4}},{"id":"declaration-record-reference","kind":"text","label":"Declaration recording reference","binding":"association.property.declaration.record_reference","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":5,"span":4}},{"id":"declaration-record-date","kind":"date","label":"Declaration recorded","binding":"association.property.declaration.recorded_date","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":9,"span":4}},{"id":"parcel-legal-description","kind":"textarea","label":"Parcel legal description / reference","binding":"association.property.parcel_legal_description","rows":3,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":1,"span":6}},{"id":"recorded-location","kind":"textarea","label":"Recorded city and county/county references","binding":"association.property.recorded_location","rows":3,"help":"Use the declaration's recorded location information. Do not treat a county-specific recorder identifier as statewide identity.","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":7,"span":6}},{"id":"plat-record-reference","kind":"text","label":"Plat recording reference","binding":"association.property.plat.record_reference","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":3,"column":1,"span":4}},{"id":"plat-record-date","kind":"date","label":"Plat recorded","binding":"association.property.plat.recorded_date","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":3,"column":5,"span":4}},{"id":"plat-surveyor","kind":"text","label":"Registered Illinois Land Surveyor","binding":"association.property.plat.surveyor","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":3,"column":9,"span":4}},{"id":"recorded-amendments","kind":"collection","label":"Recorded declaration / plat amendments","binding":"association.property.recorded_amendments","min_items":0,"item_label":"Amendment","actions":{"add_label":"Add amendment","remove_label":"Remove amendment"},"item_layout":{"columns":12},"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":4,"column":1,"span":12},"item_controls":[{"id":"property-amendment-kind","kind":"select","label":"Instrument","binding":"kind","options":[{"value":"declaration","label":"Declaration amendment"},{"value":"plat","label":"Plat amendment"},{"value":"both","label":"Declaration and plat"},{"value":"other","label":"Other recorded condominium instrument"}],"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":3}},{"id":"property-amendment-date","kind":"date","label":"Recorded","binding":"recorded_date","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":4,"span":3}},{"id":"property-amendment-reference","kind":"text","label":"Recording reference","binding":"record_reference","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":7,"span":3}},{"id":"property-amendment-notes","kind":"textarea","label":"Notes","binding":"notes","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":10,"span":3}}]},{"id":"unit-common-element-instance","title":"Units and common-element interests","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-4","il-condo-act-5","il-condo-act-6"],"layout":{"columns":12},"controls":[{"id":"unit-inventory","kind":"collection","label":"Recorded unit inventory","binding":"association.property.units","min_items":1,"item_label":"Unit","actions":{"add_label":"Add unit","remove_label":"Remove unit"},"item_layout":{"columns":12},"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":12},"item_controls":[{"id":"property-unit-designator","kind":"text","label":"Recorded unit number / symbol","binding":"designator","required":true,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":3}},{"id":"property-unit-legal-reference","kind":"textarea","label":"Unit legal description / plat reference","binding":"legal_reference","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":4,"span":4}},{"id":"property-unit-common-interest","kind":"number","label":"Common-element ownership interest","binding":"common_element_interest","min":0,"max":100,"step":0.000001,"unit":"%","format":"percent","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":8,"span":2}},{"id":"property-unit-limited-common-elements","kind":"textarea","label":"Limited common-element reference","binding":"limited_common_elements","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":10,"span":3}}]},{"id":"association-owned-real-property","kind":"collection","label":"Association-owned real property","binding":"association.property.association_owned_real_property","min_items":0,"item_label":"Property","actions":{"add_label":"Add property","remove_label":"Remove property"},"item_layout":{"columns":12},"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":1,"span":12},"item_controls":[{"id":"association-property-description","kind":"text","label":"Description","binding":"description","required":true,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":3}},{"id":"association-property-record-reference","kind":"text","label":"Deed / record reference","binding":"record_reference","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":4,"span":3}},{"id":"association-property-use","kind":"textarea","label":"Use / easement / covenant context","binding":"use_context","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":7,"span":3}},{"id":"association-property-tax-treatment","kind":"select","label":"Observed tax treatment","binding":"tax_treatment","options":[{"value":"section10_one_dollar","label":"Section 10 $1 annual assessment observed"},{"value":"other","label":"Other assessment observed"},{"value":"unknown","label":"Not yet established"}],"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":10,"span":3}}]},{"id":"association-legal-form","kind":"select","label":"Association legal form","binding":"association.property.association_legal_form","options":[{"value":"incorporated","label":"Incorporated"},{"value":"unincorporated","label":"Unincorporated"},{"value":"unknown","label":"Not yet established"}],"help":"Section 18.3 permits either form; this field records the association-specific fact.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-18-3"],"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":3,"column":1,"span":4}},{"id":"association-corporate-reference","kind":"text","label":"Corporate / Secretary of State reference, if applicable","binding":"association.property.corporate_reference","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":3,"column":5,"span":4}},{"id":"property-identity-notes","kind":"textarea","label":"Property identity notes","binding":"association.property.notes","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":3,"column":9,"span":4}}]},{"id":"tax-instance","title":"Unit tax and assessment references","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-10"],"layout":{"columns":12},"controls":[{"id":"unit-tax-records","kind":"collection","label":"Unit tax references","binding":"association.property.tax.unit_records","min_items":0,"item_label":"Tax reference","actions":{"add_label":"Add tax reference","remove_label":"Remove tax reference"},"item_layout":{"columns":12},"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":12},"item_controls":[{"id":"tax-unit-reference","kind":"text","label":"Unit reference","binding":"unit_reference","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":2}},{"id":"tax-property-identifier","kind":"text","label":"Local property / tax identifier","binding":"property_identifier","help":"County/local identifier; not statewide civic identity.","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":3,"span":3}},{"id":"tax-assessment-year","kind":"number","label":"Assessment / tax year","binding":"year","min":1900,"max":2200,"step":1,"unit":"year","format":"integer","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":6,"span":2}},{"id":"tax-district-reference","kind":"text","label":"Taxing district reference","binding":"taxing_district","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":8,"span":2}},{"id":"tax-record-reference","kind":"text","label":"Assessment / bill reference","binding":"record_reference","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":10,"span":3}}]},{"id":"association-tax-property-reference","kind":"textarea","label":"Association-owned property tax reference","binding":"association.property.tax.association_owned_property_reference","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":1,"span":6}},{"id":"tax-relief-status","kind":"select","label":"Tax assessment-relief activity","binding":"association.property.tax.relief_status","options":[{"value":"none_observed","label":"None observed"},{"value":"authorized","label":"Authorized"},{"value":"pending","label":"Pending"},{"value":"completed","label":"Completed"},{"value":"unknown","label":"Not yet established"}],"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":7,"span":3}},{"id":"tax-relief-date","kind":"date","label":"Authorization / action date","binding":"association.property.tax.relief_date","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":10,"span":3}},{"id":"tax-relief-authorization","kind":"select","label":"Authorization basis","binding":"association.property.tax.relief_authorization","options":[{"value":"board_two_thirds","label":"Two-thirds board vote"},{"value":"unit_owner_majority","label":"Majority unit-owner vote"},{"value":"greater_instrument_threshold","label":"Greater condominium-instrument threshold"},{"value":"unknown","label":"Not yet established"}],"authority_refs":["il-condo-act-10"],"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":3,"column":1,"span":4}},{"id":"tax-relief-reference","kind":"textarea","label":"Tax relief / appeal record reference","binding":"association.property.tax.relief_reference","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":3,"column":5,"span":8}}]}]}]}